WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:07.050
Welcome to LunaVerta, a free toolbox for your files that runs right in your browser.

2
00:00:07.450 --> 00:00:10.560
Drop a file, and pick what it should become in the ring.

3
00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:15.334
Or jump straight to a tool, like editing or signing a PDF.

4
00:00:15.734 --> 00:00:18.204
Fix text right inside a PDF.

5
00:00:18.604 --> 00:00:23.570
Find prices, emails and other sensitive details, and remove them for good.

6
00:00:23.970 --> 00:00:26.616
Add your signature in a few clicks.

7
00:00:27.016 --> 00:00:32.510
Your files never leave your device. It even keeps working when you go offline.

8
00:00:32.910 --> 00:00:36.116
It's free, with no sign-up. Enjoy!
